## 🎨 Parameterized Locators (Dynamic Elements)

### **When Runtime Data Identifies Elements**

For elements found by **runtime values** (user names, item names, dynamic text):

**Cache Entry**:
```json
{
  "locator": "tr:has(strong:has-text(\"{param}\")) a.btn-outline-info i.fa-eye"
}
```

**Page Object**:
```typescript
import { LocatorContextType } from 'Engine/Shared/types';

private schoolDetailsIcon: AIElement;  // Initialize in constructor

// Using convenience method with context
async clickSchoolDetails(schoolName: string): Promise<void> {
  await this.schoolDetailsIcon.click({ type: LocatorContextType.Dynamic, param: schoolName });
}

// Or using explicit locate() for multiple interactions
async clickSchoolDetailsAndVerify(schoolName: string): Promise<void> {
  const icon = this.schoolDetailsIcon.locate({ type: LocatorContextType.Dynamic, param: schoolName });
  await icon.click();
  const isVisible = await icon.isVisible();
}
```

### **Available Patterns**

**Import Required**:
```typescript
import { LocatorContextType } from 'Engine/Shared/types';
```

**Static Locator**:
```typescript
await element.click();
await element.fill('value');
```

**Dynamic Locator** (replaces old `*WithParam()` methods):
```typescript
await element.click({ type: LocatorContextType.Dynamic, param: value });
await element.fill('value', { type: LocatorContextType.Dynamic, param: paramValue });
await element.getText({ type: LocatorContextType.Dynamic, param: value });
await element.waitFor({ timeout: 5000 }, { type: LocatorContextType.Dynamic, param: value });
await element.isVisible({ type: LocatorContextType.Dynamic, param: value });
await element.select('option', { type: LocatorContextType.Dynamic, param: value });
```

**Child Within Dynamic Parent**:
```typescript
await element.click({ 
  type: LocatorContextType.WithinDynamicParent, 
  parentParam: parentValue, 
  childKey: childLocatorKey 
});
```

### **Common Locator Patterns**

```typescript
// Row by content: "tr:has(td:has-text(\"{param}\"))"
// Button by text: "button:has-text(\"{param}\")"
// In container: "div:has(h3:has-text(\"{param}\")) button.action"
```

**Rule**: NEVER use `this.page.locator()` for dynamic elements - ALWAYS use AIElement with `{param}` and context parameter

