## 📝 Element HTML Collection Workflow

Reference: **[Phase 1 - Locator Research](mdc:Phase1_LocatorResearch.mdc)**

### **Collection Before Interaction (MANDATORY)**
- Before ANY interaction with web elements, use `browser_evaluate` to extract element HTML
- Save all collected elements to `tests/Raw/Debug/ElementsCollected.ts`
- NEVER interact with element before collecting its HTML code

### **Element Structure**
```typescript
{
  description: string;      // Human-readable (native language matching test description)
  action: string;           // Action to perform (click, fill, hover, etc.)
  html: string;             // Complete HTML code of the element
  locatorSuggestion: string; // REQUIRED: Optimal Playwright locator
}
```

### **Cache Generation**
- Use `ElementsCollected.ts` as authoritative source for generating `locator_cache.json`
- The `locatorSuggestion` field MUST be used directly as `locator` value in cache
- No guessing - always collect actual HTML first

